他的声音冷酷无情至极，像是把利刃一般，将伍辰儿划得体无完肤！字字句句几乎欲将她凌迟处死！她挣扎着地想要站起来，却正对上叶子情嘴角那抹诡异的笑意，蓦然有些明白了！满是鲜血的手颤抖地指着商离天凄然一笑：“原来这一切，是你们早就预谋好的，难怪当初你不顾众人的反对也要娶我，原来一切都是为了今天！”“你现在知道已经太晚了！”商离天无情的话语将伍辰儿最后一丝幻想也打碎。尽管已经猜到，可是，亲口听他说出来，伍辰儿还是感觉心被人生生撕裂一般，消瘦的身子晃了晃，小脸亦加苍白。怨恨地眼神移到叶子情身上：“叶子情！你这个贱人！亏我一直把你当成好姐妹，你居然要吃我的心！还有你！叶天明！你的良心被狗吃了，若不是我爹一手举荐你，你哪会有今天，没想到，你们居然恩将仇报，你们一个个都要不得好死！”“放肆！”商离天怒不可遏，霍地站起来，作势就要朝伍辰儿打去。一旁叶子情连忙起身抚慰：“皇上，您就别怪辰儿了！”跟着，转向伍辰儿，还是那不易察觉的诡笑：“辰儿，皇上这么做，也是逼不得已，怪就怪，姐姐我有痛心病，而你恰恰长着一颗七窍玲珑心！你就安心上路吧！姐姐一定会厚葬你和你爹娘，逢年过节都去看你们！”她娇弱柔媚的声音，玉面梨花带雨，听得一旁的商离天是心疼不已，连忙将她拥入怀中，软言安慰。伍辰儿看着这情意绵绵的一幕，不由得肝肠寸断：“皇上，原来，你所说的白首不相离都是假的，一切都只是为了这一天！是我太蠢了！”她居然为了他不惜背上千古乱/伦的骂名，却不想换来的却是这样的下场，那张俏丽的小脸显得愈加苍白。原来她只不过是他救爱人的一抹药引，那种心痛如毒药一般浸入四肢百骸，深入骨髓！“皇上，国师说过，一定要在今天取出她的心吃了才有效……”叶子情生怕商离天会心软，故意尖叫一声，抚着胸口软了下去。“爱妃！”商离天大惊，连忙将她抱入怀中，冲一旁的天明吼道：“天明，还不动手！”“是！”叶天明提着滴血的剑一步步朝伍辰儿走来。“慢着！”伍辰儿突然喝住了他，回首望着商离天：“我的七窍玲珑心乃天所赐，也只有天子才能动手取它，叶天明，他没有资格碰我的心！”伍辰儿在赌！赌商离天最后一丝丝的情意！只是，这一局，她注定要输！", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/dizhenhuanzhizuidufeifei/2.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "The First Hatred of Genocide Ye Ziqing looked at the Wuchen people who were rushing towards him, with a strange smile on his charming lips, and seemingly frightened, he got into Shang Litian's arms for protection! Shang Litian suddenly raised his foot, kicked Wu Chen'er to the ground, pointed at her and said hatefully: \"Bitch! If the Imperial Master hadn't said that your Seven Apertures Exquisite Heart must be taken out today to be effective, I would have torn you into pieces!\" His voice was extremely cold and ruthless, like a sharp blade, cutting Wu Chen'er to pieces! Every word almost threatened to kill her! She struggled to stand up, but when she saw the weird smile on Ye Ziqing's lips, she suddenly understood! He pointed at Shang Litian with trembling hands full of blood and smiled sadly: \"It turns out that you had planned all this a long time ago. No wonder you wanted to marry me despite everyone's opposition. It turns out that it was all for today!\" \"You know now that it's too late!\" Shang Litian's ruthless words shattered Wu Chen'er's last illusion. Although he had already guessed it, Wu Chen'er still felt as if his heart was being torn apart when he heard him say it. His thin body swayed and his face became paler. Resentful eyes moved to Ye Ziqing: \"Yi Ziqing! You bitch! I have always regarded you as a good sister, but you actually want to eat my heart! And you! Ye Tianming! Your conscience was eaten by a dog. If my father hadn't recommended you, you wouldn't be here today. I didn't expect that you would repay kindness with hatred, and you would all die a good death!\" \"Presumptuous!\" Shang Litian was furious, Huo Di stood up, and was about to hit Wu Chen'er. On the side, Ye Ziqing quickly stood up and comforted: \"Your Majesty, don't blame Chen'er!\" Then, he turned to Wu Chen'er, still with the imperceptible smile: \"Chen'er, Your Majesty did this because he had no choice but to do it. It's strange. Sister, I have a heart disease, and you happen to have one. Qiqiao Exquisite Heart! You can go on your way with peace of mind! My sister will give you and your parents a good burial and come to visit you during the holidays!\" Her delicate and charming voice made Shang Litian feel heartbroken when she heard it, and he quickly hugged her and comforted her. Wu Chen'er looked at this affectionate scene and couldn't help but feel heartbroken: \"Your Majesty, it turns out that what you said about us staying together forever is a lie. Everything is just for this day! I am so stupid!\" She actually didn't hesitate to bear the infamy of incest for him, but what she didn't want to get in exchange was such an end, and her pretty little face looked even paler. It turns out that she is just a smear of medicine for him to save his lover. The heartache soaks into his limbs and bones like poison, and penetrates deep into his bones! \"Your Majesty, the Imperial Master said that her heart must be taken out and eaten today to be effective...\" Ye Ziqing was afraid that Shang Litian would relent, so she deliberately screamed, stroking her chest and softening. \"My beloved concubine!\" Shang Litian was shocked and quickly hugged her into his arms, shouting at Tianming who was standing aside: \"Tianming, don't do anything yet!\" \"Yes!\" Ye Tianming walked towards Wu Chen'er step by step with a bloody sword. \"Wait!\" Wu Chen'er suddenly stopped him and looked back at Shang Litian: \"My exquisite heart with seven orifices was given by God, and only the emperor can take it. Ye Tianming, he is not qualified to touch my heart!\" Wu Chen'er is betting! Gambler Li Tian’s last trace of affection! However, she is destined to lose in this round!", "title_en": "Chapter 2"}